WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.875
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.145 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.305 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:54.305 --> 01:57.625
BAIHU HALL

5
02:17.225 --> 02:19.025
Her Ladyship has a few heartfelt words for you.

6
02:19.545 --> 02:20.985
Listen carefully, General.

7
02:21.705 --> 02:24.945
Before entering the palace, she sent out two hundreds homing pigeons to the people.

8
02:25.665 --> 02:27.505
You may order your men to shoot them down,

9
02:28.105 --> 02:30.865
but if even one pigeon makes it out of the city,

10
02:31.465 --> 02:32.905
war will break out in flames.

11
02:33.585 --> 02:36.745
Once word spreads that the Crown Prince killed his father to seize power,

12
02:36.825 --> 02:40.065
the regional garrisons and feudal lords will all rise against him.

13
02:40.145 --> 02:42.265
How will you withstand them, General Han?

14
02:43.065 --> 02:45.025
If you want the Crown Prince to take the throne,

15
02:45.105 --> 02:46.665
you must negotiate with Her Ladyship.

16
02:47.705 --> 02:49.465
She's cautious indeed.

17
02:50.145 --> 02:53.065
She knew this rabble couldn't keep her alive,

18
02:53.745 --> 02:55.905
so she prepared a fallback plan.

19
02:55.985 --> 02:57.105
Very well.

20
02:57.705 --> 02:59.505
I'll negotiate with her.

21
03:00.905 --> 03:03.305
All of you, wait outside!

22
03:24.465 --> 03:27.625
If I didn't know you'd just lost your husband,

23
03:28.385 --> 03:31.665
I'd think you were about to get married.

24
03:32.265 --> 03:36.665
That outfit is quite dazzling.

25
03:38.345 --> 03:39.425
Don't I look beautiful?

26
03:46.745 --> 03:47.985
You do.

27
03:48.065 --> 03:53.345
In this lifeless court, you're the most dazzling flower.

28
03:53.945 --> 03:55.585
A pity you're poisonous.

29
04:00.345 --> 04:01.665
Let's get to the point.

30
04:03.265 --> 04:05.425
You're helping the Crown Prince seize the throne.

31
04:06.025 --> 04:08.105
He'll never spare my mother or me.

32
04:08.705 --> 04:10.225
I'd like to ask you

33
04:11.585 --> 04:12.865
to protect my entire clan.

34
04:12.945 --> 04:16.985
Liu Shuo has probably been captured by Grand Commandant Zheng.

35
04:17.705 --> 04:20.745
You two siblings led troops into the palace at night.

36
04:20.825 --> 04:22.865
You clearly intended to rebel.

37
04:24.665 --> 04:26.385
If the Crown Prince quells the rebellion

38
04:26.465 --> 04:28.505
and takes the throne, that's only reasonable.

39
04:33.585 --> 04:36.505
If we can settle this without bloodshed,

40
04:37.065 --> 04:39.105
I'd rather avoid a massacre.

41
04:40.625 --> 04:44.265
Now, everyone's life

42
04:47.185 --> 04:49.945
depends on your decision.

43
04:58.585 --> 04:59.905
What do you want, General?

44
04:59.985 --> 05:03.065
You and the Crown Prince are mortal enemies.

45
05:03.585 --> 05:05.465
To save you and your mother,

46
05:07.025 --> 05:08.345
there's only one way.

47
05:10.665 --> 05:12.425
You must become my wife.

48
05:15.105 --> 05:18.345
I've only just lost my husband, and you want me to remarry?

49
05:20.945 --> 05:21.865
Drop the act.

50
05:22.705 --> 05:24.705
I've seen right through you.

51
05:26.105 --> 05:28.425
Deep down, you're selfish,

52
05:28.505 --> 05:30.785
cold-hearted, and ruthless.

53
05:31.825 --> 05:33.585
No one craves the climb more than you.

54
05:35.185 --> 05:37.625
Didn't you marry Lu Zhuo for power?

55
05:39.425 --> 05:41.145
Whatever he offers you,

56
05:41.985 --> 05:44.065
I can give you too.

57
05:47.585 --> 05:49.265
I've plotted against the Hans before.

58
05:49.345 --> 05:51.825
I've built up quite a grudge with you.

59
05:52.425 --> 05:56.145
I'm afraid you'll break your word and settle the score later.

60
06:01.265 --> 06:03.545
Others worship you as a goddess,

61
06:04.065 --> 06:06.665
but I want that goddess in my arms.

62
06:12.145 --> 06:18.065
Why plot for your brother when you could plot for your own husband?

63
06:18.745 --> 06:19.865
Wei Rao,

64
06:20.905 --> 06:23.305
I'm giving you one final chance.

65
06:24.065 --> 06:25.505
If you refuse,

66
06:26.345 --> 06:27.825
I'll order the city put to the sword.

67
06:28.705 --> 06:33.665
The first to die will be your own mother.

68
06:35.585 --> 06:38.425
Think carefully.

69
06:47.065 --> 06:47.945
I'll marry you.

70
06:50.745 --> 06:51.585
Really?

71
07:00.945 --> 07:01.865
You…

72
07:05.345 --> 07:06.385
You…

73
07:07.625 --> 07:09.305
You vile woman…

74
07:09.385 --> 07:10.705
Poison!

75
07:12.225 --> 07:14.465
He knew I'd like to have a blade beneath my pillow.

76
07:15.985 --> 07:17.345
He didn't blame me for it,

77
07:18.545 --> 07:20.265
instead, he gave me this ring.

78
07:23.425 --> 07:25.105
How could you ever compare to him?

79
07:28.425 --> 07:30.345
Xiao! Now!

80
07:31.105 --> 07:32.665
By imperial decree, Noble Lady Wu'an is here to purge the treacherous.

81
07:32.745 --> 07:34.425
Lay down your weapons before the Zi hour,

82
07:34.505 --> 07:36.305
and you shall be pardoned.

83
07:36.385 --> 07:38.425
Anyone who continues to side with the rebels

84
07:39.385 --> 07:40.465
will be eliminated!

85
07:42.745 --> 07:44.865
Your Highness, the Empress Dowager is confined to Changle Palace for now.

86
07:46.745 --> 07:47.905
Your Highness,

87
07:49.185 --> 07:50.865
you mustn't hesitate now.

88
07:54.425 --> 07:55.385
Search!

89
07:55.465 --> 07:57.785
Find the Imperial Seal at all costs!

90
08:02.945 --> 08:04.265
Guard His Majesty.

91
08:14.145 --> 08:15.345
That's oil.

92
08:16.265 --> 08:18.505
Wei Rao, what are you doing?

93
08:26.345 --> 08:29.105
Your Highness, you've stormed the palace in the dead of night.

94
08:29.185 --> 08:31.065
What exactly do you intend?

95
08:31.145 --> 08:34.385
To kill the wicked consort and rid Father's court of evil, of course.

96
08:37.345 --> 08:39.825
Your Highness, we've searched everywhere. No sign of the seal.

97
08:41.625 --> 08:42.825
Where is it?

98
08:43.425 --> 08:46.745
His Majesty is gravely ill and allows only me to attend to him.

99
08:47.385 --> 08:50.825
I'm the only one who knows where the Imperial Seal is.

100
08:51.425 --> 08:54.025
Hand over the seal, and I may leave your corpse intact.

101
08:55.065 --> 08:56.785
I want to see my daughter.

102
08:57.825 --> 08:59.425
My whole life,

103
09:01.225 --> 09:02.385
my mother,

104
09:02.985 --> 09:05.665
my father and my grandmother,

105
09:06.985 --> 09:08.945
they all wanted something,

106
09:10.385 --> 09:12.625
and all of it mattered more than me.

107
09:23.945 --> 09:25.825
Only he was different.

108
09:30.665 --> 09:32.185
He stayed by my side

109
09:32.945 --> 09:34.185
and cared for me.

110
09:36.345 --> 09:38.905
Even though I pushed him away again and again,

111
09:42.745 --> 09:45.465
he'd always hold me close again,

112
09:46.985 --> 09:48.905
asking nothing in return.

113
09:50.105 --> 09:51.785
In this world,

114
09:53.905 --> 09:55.825
he was the only one who put me first.

115
09:57.545 --> 09:59.465
No one could ever replace him.

116
10:02.105 --> 10:06.105
But you killed him.

117
10:07.305 --> 10:09.465
How dare you kill my husband?

118
10:19.825 --> 10:22.105
The truth is, whether he lives

119
10:24.505 --> 10:25.985
or dies matters not,

120
10:29.505 --> 10:31.185
he belongs to me.

121
10:36.025 --> 10:38.745
I want this love to last through every lifetime,

122
10:39.545 --> 10:41.065
never to fade.

123
10:45.425 --> 10:47.545
So why should I fear death?

124
10:49.945 --> 10:50.785
Wei Rao,

125
10:52.425 --> 10:54.505
-don't… -Don't worry.

126
10:57.385 --> 10:59.145
Once I've killed you,

127
10:59.225 --> 11:00.985
I'll go after the Crown Prince!

128
11:56.385 --> 11:59.385
Han Liao tried to turn Qi Zhongkai and me against each other.

129
11:59.465 --> 12:01.825
So I devised a plan to fake my death and lure the enemy in.

130
12:02.865 --> 12:04.105
That day in the Death Valley,

131
12:04.785 --> 12:06.905
I led my men out along a path on the cliff face

132
12:07.425 --> 12:09.585
and left a body I'd prepared in advance in my place.

133
12:10.785 --> 12:15.705
General Lu has fallen, taking the Hutuo soldiers with him!

134
12:30.785 --> 12:34.425
In every lifetime, she will always be my wife.

135
12:35.305 --> 12:38.225
As for you, you can go to hell.

136
13:00.185 --> 13:01.385
BAIHU HALL

137
13:03.905 --> 13:04.745
Your Highness,

138
13:04.825 --> 13:06.785
Noble Lady Wu'an wants to burn General Han alive!

139
13:06.865 --> 13:08.945
Rao! My Rao!

140
13:09.705 --> 13:10.585
Where is the seal?

141
13:10.665 --> 13:13.225
I swear on my honor as Crown Prince to spare you and your daughter.

142
13:13.305 --> 13:14.425
I'll keep my word!

143
13:15.465 --> 13:16.825
One last lesson for you.

144
13:17.425 --> 13:20.425
Break your word, and even if you win the throne,

145
13:20.945 --> 13:21.945
you won't keep it.

146
13:23.505 --> 13:26.385
The seal is buried in the peach grove southeast of Xuanshi Palace.

147
13:27.025 --> 13:28.705
Go and dig it up yourself!

148
13:29.225 --> 13:30.185
-Hurry! -Rao!

149
13:30.265 --> 13:31.425
Find the seal!

150
13:31.505 --> 13:32.745
-Yes. -The Crown Prince gave his word.

151
13:32.825 --> 13:33.665
-All of you, go! -Rao!

152
13:33.745 --> 13:34.585
But I didn't.

153
13:36.745 --> 13:38.025
Rao!

154
13:38.625 --> 13:39.545
Rao!

155
13:43.505 --> 13:45.105
Rao!

156
13:46.465 --> 13:47.345
Shoot!

157
13:48.345 --> 13:49.785
Rao!

158
13:51.745 --> 13:52.785
-General Lu. -General Lu!

159
13:53.385 --> 13:55.105
-Rao! -Mother!

160
14:00.785 --> 14:03.825
We've followed General Lu's plan and secured the Imperial City.

161
14:03.905 --> 14:05.225
Zheng Tan has been captured.

162
14:06.785 --> 14:08.265
Rao!

163
14:14.305 --> 14:15.225
Seize the rebel leader!

164
14:15.825 --> 14:16.985
Charge!

165
14:25.065 --> 14:26.145
What did you…

166
14:27.945 --> 14:29.505
What did you just call me?

167
14:31.105 --> 14:32.625
I heard everything.

168
14:35.145 --> 14:38.745
You offered the Imperial Seal in exchange for my life.

169
14:45.065 --> 14:49.945
How could the Imperial Seal matter more than my precious daughter?

170
15:04.065 --> 15:04.945
Everyone, stop!

171
15:17.225 --> 15:18.145
Aman,

172
15:19.825 --> 15:22.305
Wei Shu is gone. Go.

173
15:23.505 --> 15:24.545
Find her.

174
16:05.265 --> 16:07.825
When the Fourth Prince was brought into the palace,

175
16:08.345 --> 16:10.145
I said I wanted to come and have a look too.

176
16:11.545 --> 16:15.105
I'm glad I came.

177
16:16.105 --> 16:18.705
Make her suffer every punishment

178
16:19.545 --> 16:22.705
she inflicted on those innocent girls

179
16:24.305 --> 16:26.465
before sending her to the scaffold.

180
16:33.465 --> 16:36.705
Let go of me! Let go! I'm the Crown Princess!

181
16:36.785 --> 16:38.825
A lowly woman like you has no right to judge me!

182
16:39.865 --> 16:40.905
Where's Wei Rao?

183
16:41.585 --> 16:43.065
Ask her to come and speak to me.

184
16:44.225 --> 16:46.545
What? Is she afraid?

185
16:47.305 --> 16:50.505
That's because she's a night-soil woman.

186
16:50.585 --> 16:51.545
A night-soil woman!

187
16:54.665 --> 16:56.745
-Let go! -Had my sister been in your place tonight,

188
16:56.825 --> 16:58.465
she'd have marched straight in,

189
16:58.545 --> 17:00.425
held the Emperor to command the realm.

190
17:01.105 --> 17:04.224
But to settle a private grudge, you went straight to Zhuyu Estate

191
17:04.825 --> 17:07.065
and wasted your best chance.

192
17:07.665 --> 17:12.105
You're too foolish and shortsighted to be a worthy opponent for my sister.

193
17:15.305 --> 17:16.145
Take her away.

194
17:17.224 --> 17:19.464
Wei Rao!

195
17:19.545 --> 17:21.464
Come out!

196
17:26.464 --> 17:28.464
My voice sounds awful.

197
17:30.145 --> 17:31.145
Xiao,

198
17:34.705 --> 17:36.625
the guilty have been punished,

199
17:37.585 --> 17:41.705
and those who died unjustly can finally rest in peace.

200
17:42.225 --> 17:43.065
They will.

201
17:43.985 --> 17:45.385
And I wish you, Lady Hongxian,

202
17:46.225 --> 17:49.665
all the happiness you hope for and a smooth road ahead.

203
18:02.945 --> 18:05.705
I was blind drunk last night and couldn't come to your aid in time.

204
18:05.785 --> 18:06.985
Please forgive me, Father.

205
18:07.065 --> 18:09.745
I've arrested every member of the traitorous Zheng family.

206
18:10.865 --> 18:14.065
Better to arrive late than to join the wrong side.

207
18:15.345 --> 18:17.465
Liu Shou has committed high treason

208
18:18.305 --> 18:19.625
and violated the bonds of family.

209
18:20.665 --> 18:21.825
He is stripped of his rank

210
18:23.705 --> 18:24.665
and ordered

211
18:26.905 --> 18:28.105
to take his own life.

212
18:29.705 --> 18:31.785
On an auspicious day, I shall inform the ancestors

213
18:32.505 --> 18:35.105
of the appointment of my fourth son, Liu Shuo, as heir,

214
18:35.945 --> 18:37.305
to secure the realm.

215
18:42.105 --> 18:43.985
So that's it.

216
18:44.865 --> 18:47.185
You were waiting until Liu Shuo was strong enough

217
18:47.945 --> 18:51.065
to inherit the throne before deposing me.

218
18:51.665 --> 18:53.705
You foresaw trouble in the palace

219
18:53.785 --> 18:56.185
and immediately sent men to protect him.

220
18:56.265 --> 19:00.025
Through all of it, Liu Shuo's hands are the only ones that never shed blood.

221
19:01.785 --> 19:03.105
Father,

222
19:03.745 --> 19:05.585
how could you be so biased

223
19:08.305 --> 19:09.985
and so unfair?

224
19:13.145 --> 19:14.105
Guards.

225
19:26.465 --> 19:27.425
Liu Ding,

226
19:28.945 --> 19:30.745
if you dare harbor treasonous thoughts,

227
19:32.025 --> 19:33.545
let his fate be a warning.

228
19:35.065 --> 19:36.945
I would never dare, Father!

229
19:40.105 --> 19:41.145
Wei Rao.

230
19:46.945 --> 19:47.945
Your Majesty.

231
19:48.865 --> 19:52.105
I've seen all that you've done.

232
19:52.865 --> 19:56.505
You've carried on your father's legacy, stayed true to your country,

233
19:57.385 --> 20:00.905
served its people, and remained loyal to your sovereign.

234
20:01.585 --> 20:03.265
Quelling the rebellion, founding the realm

235
20:03.345 --> 20:04.745
a great service to the state.

236
20:05.345 --> 20:08.865
I hereby name you the Princess Protector of the Realm

237
20:08.945 --> 20:10.505
and add 5000 households to your fief.

238
20:11.785 --> 20:14.305
I thank Your Majesty for this honor.

239
20:17.625 --> 20:18.745
Rise.

240
20:24.865 --> 20:26.025
Lu Zhuo.

241
20:28.945 --> 20:29.905
Your Majesty.

242
20:30.505 --> 20:32.305
Shuo is Wei Rao's brother.

243
20:33.705 --> 20:35.625
Henceforth, treat him not as your sovereign,

244
20:35.705 --> 20:37.945
but as your own brother,

245
20:38.785 --> 20:42.025
guiding him whenever he strays and supporting him wholeheartedly.

246
20:42.625 --> 20:44.985
I shall do all I can

247
20:45.745 --> 20:47.185
to live up to Your Majesty's trust.

248
20:56.385 --> 20:57.265
Father.

249
21:01.785 --> 21:02.905
Shuo,

250
21:03.705 --> 21:04.985
in three days,

251
21:05.505 --> 21:08.105
I shall preside over your coming-of-age ceremony.

252
21:21.665 --> 21:24.785
XUANSHI PALACE

253
21:41.545 --> 21:42.945
An emperor's mind

254
21:44.105 --> 21:45.505
is truly unfathomable.

255
21:46.105 --> 21:48.025
He wasn't only testing the deposed Crown Prince.

256
21:49.905 --> 21:50.745
He was testing you too.

257
21:54.985 --> 21:56.025
Testing me?

258
21:59.185 --> 22:00.145
Your Highness,

259
22:00.865 --> 22:01.745
General Lu,

260
22:04.385 --> 22:06.025
shouldn't you be thanking your matchmaker?

261
22:06.825 --> 22:08.265
What do you mean?

262
22:08.345 --> 22:11.225
The plan was to test you, but Lu Zhuo refused to go along with it,

263
22:11.305 --> 22:12.985
so I gave him a stronger dose

264
22:13.065 --> 22:15.145
and stop Zhao Song from sending word.

265
22:15.225 --> 22:17.385
Otherwise, how would we know your true feelings?

266
22:17.465 --> 22:18.625
-You… -Lu Zhuo,

267
22:19.145 --> 22:20.145
you owe me your thanks.

268
22:21.265 --> 22:22.705
Where else would you find one

269
22:23.225 --> 22:25.065
so selfless, seeking no reward?

270
22:26.465 --> 22:28.185
So that's what happened.

271
22:30.505 --> 22:31.345
That's right.

272
22:31.425 --> 22:32.985
I certainly owe you my thanks!

273
22:33.065 --> 22:35.265
The general repays kindness with violence!

274
22:36.225 --> 22:39.345
Your Highness, mind your manners.

275
22:45.185 --> 22:46.385
Tell me.

276
22:46.905 --> 22:48.385
When did you wake up in the coffin?

277
22:49.705 --> 22:53.545
Just in time to hear you say that our bond is unbreakable

278
22:53.625 --> 22:54.745
and you can't do without me.

279
22:55.465 --> 22:57.305
‎All right, okay, my fault.

280
23:01.705 --> 23:02.945
How can you cast me aside after all I've done?

281
23:03.025 --> 23:04.465
-Wait up! -I know.

282
23:05.065 --> 23:05.905
-It's my fault. -Your Majesty,

283
23:06.425 --> 23:08.505
why not set state affairs aside for now

284
23:08.585 --> 23:10.345
and go recover at the traveling palace?

285
23:10.425 --> 23:11.385
No, I can't.

286
23:11.985 --> 23:16.705
I must see Shuo secure on the throne.

287
23:17.745 --> 23:18.745
Otherwise,

288
23:20.225 --> 23:22.265
I won't be able to rest in peace.

289
23:30.385 --> 23:32.785
Shuo is still young.

290
23:34.185 --> 23:37.105
The feudal lords won't respect his authority.

291
23:37.825 --> 23:40.145
To secure his throne,

292
23:41.665 --> 23:44.425
he'll need his sister's reputation with the people

293
23:44.505 --> 23:48.065
as well as the support from Lu Zhuo and the others.

294
24:10.185 --> 24:13.385
The Emperor departed this life in the early summer of the next year.

295
24:13.945 --> 24:16.545
Crown Prince Liu Shuo ascends the throne,

296
24:16.625 --> 24:19.225
ushering in the Xihe era.

297
24:19.305 --> 24:21.745
‎XUANSHI PALACE

298
25:02.585 --> 25:04.465
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

299
25:04.545 --> 25:08.025
FOURTH MONTH OF THE THIRD YEAR OF XIHE

300
25:15.065 --> 25:17.425
SHIZHAI

301
25:42.145 --> 25:43.025
To kill at close range,

302
25:43.625 --> 25:45.745
you can't rely only on tricks like hidden weapons.

303
25:46.705 --> 25:50.065
This move is called Redirecting Force.

304
25:56.585 --> 25:57.625
Be serious.

305
26:05.305 --> 26:06.705
Like this?

306
26:10.905 --> 26:14.345
I'm not showing you. You'll only blame me again.

307
26:23.585 --> 26:25.745
My brave and mighty general,

308
26:27.825 --> 26:29.345
am I doing it right?

309
26:45.705 --> 26:46.985
SONGYUE HALL

310
26:53.545 --> 26:55.465
Your Highness, Hongxian has sent a secret message.

311
26:55.545 --> 26:56.665
His Majesty fell from his horse while hunting and was badly injured.

312
26:56.745 --> 26:58.705
She asks you to enter the palace at once.

313
27:16.185 --> 27:18.745
Your Majesty. Your Majesty.

314
27:20.425 --> 27:21.425
Your Majesty.

315
27:25.425 --> 27:26.465
Your Majesty.

316
27:39.545 --> 27:41.745
Rao, you're here.

317
27:42.785 --> 27:44.785
Mother cried so hard she fainted.

318
27:44.865 --> 27:47.385
I've had her taken back to her palace to rest.

319
27:48.025 --> 27:51.185
His Majesty has been waiting for you.

320
27:52.385 --> 27:55.265
It was getting late, and the weather in the mountains turned.

321
27:55.865 --> 27:56.785
I advised to return,

322
27:56.865 --> 27:57.985
but he insisted on hunting down that wild fox.

323
27:58.985 --> 28:00.025
Then we encountered a bear.

324
28:00.665 --> 28:02.585
Who knew there would be a bear there?

325
28:02.665 --> 28:04.265
It suddenly charged at us and killed two guards.

326
28:04.345 --> 28:05.705
-His Majesty… -His Majesty needs to rest.

327
28:07.465 --> 28:09.145
Please leave, Prince Fu.

328
28:25.225 --> 28:28.145
It was him. It was him!

329
28:29.945 --> 28:32.065
He led His Majesty into those woods.

330
28:33.425 --> 28:35.465
His Majesty just sent him off to his fief

331
28:35.545 --> 28:36.905
and then this happened.

332
28:37.505 --> 28:40.545
Rao, he's the culprit.

333
28:42.585 --> 28:43.665
Rao.

334
28:44.425 --> 28:45.625
I'm here.

335
28:46.545 --> 28:47.785
What do you want to say?

336
28:48.505 --> 28:50.745
When Father died,

337
28:51.385 --> 28:55.505
he told me to be kind to my only remaining brother.

338
28:56.425 --> 28:59.545
Though you urged me time and again to kill him,

339
29:00.305 --> 29:03.465
I always showed him leniency.

340
29:03.545 --> 29:06.705
I know. I know you did.

341
29:07.465 --> 29:08.505
For three years,

342
29:09.705 --> 29:13.905
he was cautious and respectful in every way.

343
29:14.545 --> 29:15.625
But all along,

344
29:16.265 --> 29:17.785
he was lying low,

345
29:18.665 --> 29:20.665
waiting for his chance.

346
29:20.745 --> 29:22.105
Tomorrow's the day,

347
29:22.625 --> 29:25.105
once in three years,

348
29:25.185 --> 29:28.545
when the feudal lords come to the capital to pay their respects.

349
29:31.385 --> 29:33.665
Stop talking. You need to rest.

350
29:35.225 --> 29:36.145
Your Majesty…

351
29:37.825 --> 29:40.065
Shuo…

352
29:41.385 --> 29:42.225
Your Majesty…

353
29:44.265 --> 29:48.825
I thought I'd live a hundred years,

354
29:49.545 --> 29:52.345
long enough to be a worthy emperor.

355
29:53.145 --> 29:57.185
Together, we can build

356
29:58.505 --> 30:00.025
an age of peace and prosperity.

357
30:02.185 --> 30:03.505
I never thought…

358
30:06.385 --> 30:07.945
I never thought

359
30:08.705 --> 30:13.025
I wouldn't live to see tomorrow's dawn.

360
30:15.625 --> 30:17.585
-Your Majesty… -Rao.

361
30:17.665 --> 30:19.185
-I'm here. -Rao.

362
30:19.265 --> 30:21.465
I'm here.

363
30:22.545 --> 30:23.465
I…

364
30:24.985 --> 30:26.345
I'm so afraid.

365
30:27.345 --> 30:28.345
Don't be afraid.

366
30:28.865 --> 30:31.505
I'm here. Don't be afraid, Shuo.

367
30:32.705 --> 30:34.705
It's not fair.

368
30:35.225 --> 30:36.665
It's not fair.

369
30:56.385 --> 30:57.305
Shuo.

370
30:58.865 --> 30:59.745
Your Majesty…

371
30:59.825 --> 31:01.305
Shuo.

372
31:06.425 --> 31:10.305
Shuo!

373
31:11.185 --> 31:12.345
Your Majesty!

374
31:14.825 --> 31:16.305
Your Majesty!

375
31:18.945 --> 31:20.465
What ominous signs?

376
31:20.545 --> 31:21.865
Didn't I succeed?

377
31:21.945 --> 31:24.465
If I'd known, I wouldn't have waited three years.

378
31:24.545 --> 31:27.225
All just a woman's foolish fears. I should've made my move long ago.

379
31:32.905 --> 31:34.145
Lu Zhuo, what are you doing?

380
31:34.745 --> 31:37.225
This is the imperial palace. How dare you do as you please here?

381
31:38.785 --> 31:39.865
Seize him.

382
31:43.145 --> 31:46.225
Lu Zhuo, I'm the late Emperor's son.

383
31:46.785 --> 31:48.305
You can't kill me.

384
31:49.105 --> 31:52.545
I want to see the Grand Empress Dowager! I insist!

385
31:53.425 --> 31:55.145
If the Princess Protector of the Realm wants you dead,

386
31:56.145 --> 31:58.225
you must have committed an unforgivable crime.

387
31:59.025 --> 32:00.305
You won't get the chance.

388
32:06.425 --> 32:07.345
My Lord,

389
32:07.425 --> 32:09.985
Prince Rong and 13 other feudal lords have arrived in the capital.

390
32:10.505 --> 32:13.505
The Grand Empress Dowager hosts a grand banquet to welcome them.

391
32:14.345 --> 32:17.145
Prince Fu is the guest of honor.

392
32:22.345 --> 32:24.105
BAIHU HALL

393
32:24.185 --> 32:26.025
It seems they've chosen the next Emperor.

394
32:28.185 --> 32:29.945
Poor Shuo.

395
32:32.345 --> 32:33.305
How despicable they are!

396
32:34.625 --> 32:35.665
Let's go.

397
32:37.025 --> 32:38.225
To Xuanshi Palace.

398
32:46.505 --> 32:47.505
It's over.

399
32:49.065 --> 32:50.825
It's all over.

400
32:51.705 --> 32:53.345
The princes will enter the palace tomorrow.

401
32:53.945 --> 32:57.145
With His Majesty dead, the realm will fall into chaos.

402
32:58.305 --> 33:01.545
Of the late Emperor's sons, only Prince Fu remains.

403
33:01.625 --> 33:03.465
Prince Fu is dead!

404
33:07.065 --> 33:12.705
His Majesty loved his brother and chose him to join him in death.

405
33:19.745 --> 33:20.945
By now,

406
33:23.105 --> 33:27.185
he's followed His Majesty to the underworld.

407
33:30.985 --> 33:31.865
But

408
33:33.145 --> 33:34.905
Prince Rong is still alive.

409
33:35.585 --> 33:39.225
The Grand Empress Dowager will surely put her youngest son on the throne.

410
33:40.305 --> 33:41.945
Once he takes the throne,

411
33:42.025 --> 33:44.945
the Empress Dowager,

412
33:45.465 --> 33:47.665
you, the Princess Protector of the Realm, and I

413
33:47.745 --> 33:49.865
will all be doomed.

414
33:59.105 --> 34:00.945
Oh, Heaven.

415
34:03.185 --> 34:04.625
Why?

416
34:06.745 --> 34:08.105
Why?

417
34:10.344 --> 34:14.304
Whenever I think things are finally getting better,

418
34:15.225 --> 34:17.625
you just cast me back into the abyss,

419
34:19.625 --> 34:20.784
driving me

420
34:22.665 --> 34:27.505
into despair again and again?

421
34:33.145 --> 34:35.865
How much more do you want to put me through?

422
34:35.945 --> 34:39.425
Is seeing me in agony the only thing that satisfies you?

423
34:41.784 --> 34:42.945
Why?

424
34:45.304 --> 34:47.665
Why?

425
34:48.264 --> 34:50.145
Shuo!

426
34:50.665 --> 34:52.945
Shuo!

427
34:56.985 --> 34:58.145
Rao.

428
35:44.185 --> 35:45.625
Open the doors

429
35:47.225 --> 35:48.625
and all the windows.

430
36:07.665 --> 36:09.265
Issue my orders.

431
36:11.065 --> 36:12.585
His Majesty has passed away.

432
36:13.745 --> 36:15.945
The Grand Empress Dowager is in mourning

433
36:17.305 --> 36:20.265
and should not receive the feudal lords.

434
36:22.265 --> 36:25.185
As Princess Protector of the Realm,

435
36:27.065 --> 36:29.665
I shall receive them instead.

436
37:27.745 --> 37:30.225
XUANSHI PALACE

437
37:37.345 --> 37:40.625
Whatever trials and disasters may befall me,

438
37:41.905 --> 37:43.625
I'll get through them all.

439
37:45.265 --> 37:47.825
I'll find a way to make them submit.

440
37:49.425 --> 37:52.225
Everything will get better,

441
37:53.785 --> 37:55.745
as long as I live.

442
37:57.825 --> 38:00.545
As long as I am alive.

443
38:00.625 --> 38:02.905
‎THE END

444
40:09.905 --> 40:12.905
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
